      en: ["Provides a 360-degree view of both Fontvieille and Port Hercule.", "The cannons on display were gifted by King Louis XIV of France.", "The site of the daily changing of the guard ceremony at 11:55 AM.", "Part of the original defensive fortifications of the Grimaldi fortress.", "Offers a clear view of the Stade Louis II and Monaco's heliport.", "The most popular photography spot for tourists visiting the Prince's Palace."],
