      en: ["The paving consists of durable reddish and grey natural stone blocks.", "The square originally served as a military drill ground for the fortress.", "The daily Changing of the Guard occurs on this paving at 11:55 AM precisely.", "The stone patterns delineate driving paths for official state motorcades.", "The square's surface underwent its last significant renovation in the 1990s.", "The layout is engineered to ensure efficient rainwater drainage across the site."],
